```

---

### STEP 5 — Create `.dockerignore` (in frontend root)
```
# Dependencies
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# Build output
build/
dist/

# Environment files
.env
.env.local
.env.development
.env.production

# Git
.git/
.gitignore

# Docker
Dockerfile
.dockerignore

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
```

